    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yo</i>, it\u2019s the only game that\u2019s as melodic as it is magnetic. That\u2019s right: it\u2019s <i>POLARIBALL</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one goal in Polariball: Get in the zone. Stay in the zone. Push for the top score, and get lost in the music doing it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.poster.avif?t=1754062791\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.webm?t=1754062791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.mp4?t=1754062791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin magnets, flip polarities, and smash your way through a circuit of targets, sawblades, and power-ups. It\u2019s gameplay like a freestyle: reactive, funky, and smooth as butter when you hit the pocket. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/195fda4d27efe60b9e7536f9a47efb56.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE GROOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not moving the ball; you're guiding the forces that move the ball. Rotate magnets, swap polarity, and you\u2019ll be ballin\u2019 in no time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/7483f94b3782d4b0607984434f54e85a.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL THE RHYTHM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We keep the music fresh here at Polariball, with a <strong>hip-hop inspired soundtrack</strong> that dynamically flows to match the moment-to-moment gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/1b2050cb8e6ec247b05f5f63867c59bd.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIX IT UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get funky with <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, feel the flow in <strong>Snake Mode</strong>, or you can pump it up by taking on the <strong>13 unique and hardcore Challenges</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/a932949fa2d6a0bae845fba7258e77c4.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE FLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to prove your Polariball mastery? We\u2019ve got you covered with <strong>15 Feats</strong> for you to knock out. Find out for sure if you're all that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/dee0d9539b62cc5549ed4cf370de764d.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE ON THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to be the best? Our <strong>Online Leaderboards</strong> will prove it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yo</i>, it\u2019s the only game that\u2019s as melodic as it is magnetic. That\u2019s right: it\u2019s <i>POLARIBALL</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one goal in Polariball: Get in the zone. Stay in the zone. Push for the top score, and get lost in the music doing it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.poster.avif?t=1754062791\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.webm?t=1754062791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/5290f6ca0acf22e55923a2f3e077c217.mp4?t=1754062791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin magnets, flip polarities, and smash your way through a circuit of targets, sawblades, and power-ups. It\u2019s gameplay like a freestyle: reactive, funky, and smooth as butter when you hit the pocket. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/195fda4d27efe60b9e7536f9a47efb56.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE GROOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not moving the ball; you're guiding the forces that move the ball. Rotate magnets, swap polarity, and you\u2019ll be ballin\u2019 in no time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/7483f94b3782d4b0607984434f54e85a.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL THE RHYTHM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We keep the music fresh here at Polariball, with a <strong>hip-hop inspired soundtrack</strong> that dynamically flows to match the moment-to-moment gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/1b2050cb8e6ec247b05f5f63867c59bd.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIX IT UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get funky with <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, feel the flow in <strong>Snake Mode</strong>, or you can pump it up by taking on the <strong>13 unique and hardcore Challenges</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/a932949fa2d6a0bae845fba7258e77c4.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE FLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to prove your Polariball mastery? We\u2019ve got you covered with <strong>15 Feats</strong> for you to knock out. Find out for sure if you're all that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/extras/dee0d9539b62cc5549ed4cf370de764d.avif?t=1754062791\" width=1024 height=383 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE ON THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to be the best? Our <strong>Online Leaderboards</strong> will prove it.</p>",
